# Normalise to LF in the repository. The .txt twins are compared byte for byte
# by test/md-twin.test.mjs, so leaving line endings to the platform is how that
# check turns red on one machine and green on another.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
# Release packages: never touched for line endings, never diffed as text.
*.zip binary
